l":"https://api.github.com/users/mantognini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantognini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SFML/SFML/issues/comments/5266341","html_url":"https://github.com/SFML/SFML/issues/207#issuecomment-5266341","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SFML/SFML/issues/207","id":5266341,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUyNjYzNDE=","user":{"login":"bibhas","id":94200,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MjAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bibhas","html_url":"https://github.com/bibhas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bibhas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bibhas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bibhas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bibhas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bibhas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bibhas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bibhas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bibhas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bibhas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2012-04-22T08:30:06Z","updated_at":"2012-04-22T08:30:06Z","body":"I think I've figured it out.\n\nIn examples/cocoa/CMakeLists.txt, \n\n```\nset(RESOURCE_PATH \"cocoa.app/Contents/Resources\")\n```\n\nneeds a 'Release' or 'Debug' added to it (because that's where the app is being compiled to.\n\n```\nset(RESOURCE_PATH \"Release/cocoa.app/Contents/Resources\")\n```\n\nNow, I don't know what the CMake way to get the version type variable is so not sure how we could do that automatically (?)\n\nCheers!\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SFML/SFML/issues/commen